# Tell clangd which C++ compiler drives the project so it picks up the
# matching system include paths (libstdc++ <span>, <variant>, etc.).
# Without QueryDriver clangd uses its own bundled resource dir which on
# this host lacks the C++20 headers the runtime ABI uses.
CompileFlags:
  Add: [-std=c++20]
  QueryDriver: /usr/bin/c++
